From d5bf8b19b4d12aa70ad391b3c12c74e92081d52a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shuuri-labs <61762328+shuuri-labs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:57:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] ds_inhibit: Default to disabled

It inhibits the kernel evdev nodes of Sony pads while Steam holds their
hidraw. InputPlumber reads those same nodes, so with it on a DualSense goes
silent once Steam starts. It can still be enabled through state.toml.
---
 steamos-manager/src/daemon/root.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/steamos-manager/src/daemon/root.rs b/steamos-manager/src/daemon/root.rs
index 7a71215..bff19a3 100644
--- a/steamos-manager/src/daemon/root.rs
+++ b/steamos-manager/src/daemon/root.rs
@@ -59,7 +59,7 @@ pub(crate) struct DsInhibit {
 
 impl Default for DsInhibit {
     fn default() -> DsInhibit {
-        DsInhibit { enabled: true }
+        DsInhibit { enabled: false }
     }
 }
 
